                        <p>I turn your ideas into functional, engaging, and innovative applications.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-6">
                    <div class="servicescontent">
                        <div class="noborderspin">
                            <img src="/images/progPic/system-development.png" alt="">
