                        <h4>Video Editing</h4>
                        <p>I craft professional, polished videos that tell compelling stories.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-6">
                    <div class="servicescontent">
                        <div class="noborderspin">
                            <img src="/images/progPic/cyber-security.png" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <h4>Cybersecurity</h4>
                        <p>I secure your digital assets with robust and reliable cybersecurity solutions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
